       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SQLCASE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 N PIC 99 VALUE 17.
       01 K PIC 9 VALUE 1.
       01 IND PIC S9(4) VALUE 0.
       01 SQLCODE PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
       01 SQLSTATE PIC X(5) VALUE '00000'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           EXEC SQL SELECT VALUE INTO :N :IND FROM T
               WHERE K = :K END-EXEC
           DISPLAY N
           GOBACK.
